# Floor-2 exit and the surface walk to the depot reader, all by player input (item67g):
# the LiftManager's own states open the live floor-2 LiftDoor1; the destroyed Porte20 export is
# not part of the level (bDeleteMe). The walk then follows the map's own ReachSpec/PathNode chain
# (measured with `xiii-tool nav` + `xiii-tool box-probe`; every leg is clear at the nav-node
# height): south from the doorway to (-2681,2436), (-2681,2061), (-2702,1766), then
# (-2974,1629) -> (-3127,1598) -> (-3300,1722) and west along the y~1790 corridor
# (-3414,1792) .. (-4962,722), then around the x=-5120 BSP wall via AttackPoint47 (-5121,963) to
# the depot reader. The item67f dead-end at (-2854,2338) was a wrong turn off this chain, not a
# blocker (the wall is real BSP); the item67 surface teleport is removed.
