# The depot reader by player input: the aim-focus targeting picks MagneticPassTrigger1
# (bCanTrigger), but the player carries no matching power-up item, so the controller's Grab
# tail only runs XIIITriggers.PlayerTrigger (the reader's sound/goal side effects) - item67e
# reports this as UseOutcome::PlayerTriggerOnly, not an item activation. The magnetic card
# itself is unreachable (see the "depot" pin below).
t=400.00 yaw 224
t=400.50 use
